Package: com.551.glowiconposition
Name: GlowIconPosition
Version: 1.1.7
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Moves all Glow notification icons up or down together from Settings and extends Glow's Notification Icon Scale maximum from 2.5 to 3.0 while keeping its default unchanged.
Maintainer: 551
Author: 551
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0), mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader
